msgid ""
"A shift whose cash difference exceeds this amount asks for a confirmation "
"when it is closed."
msgstr ""
"Yon chanjman travay ki gen yon diferans kès ki depase montan sa a mande "
"konfimasyon lè yo fèmen l."

